	)
	(text "- I(R_TEST) = (2.495 V x R3/(R2+R3))/R4 = 49.9 mA.  V_AMP = 16.04 x 49.9 mA x R_TEST = 0.800 V/ohm (lineal 0-1.2 ohm)."
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
		(at 15.24 214.63 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.4 1.4)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "2fc207e1-a525-5b08-b68c-014334a53085")
	)
	(text "- R5 = 6.65k (G = 16.04) en lugar de 2.5k: con G = 41 la etapa interna del INA333 se satura para R_TEST > 0.48 ohm (ver SIM 2 LTspice)."
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
		(at 15.24 218.44 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.4 1.4)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "3943f9f6-2bf9-560d-bedf-50b81e72307f")
	)
	(text "- Medicion Kelvin en J2: 1 = I+ (emisor Q2), 2 = S+ (v_volt), 3 = S- (v_base), 4 = I- (R4 / realimentacion LM358)."
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
		(at 15.24 222.25 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.4 1.4)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "631c769d-ea77-53c7-b60d-8928229d4239")
	)
	(text "- ADS1252: VREF = misma referencia TL431 -> medicion ratiometrica: R = codigo/2^23 x (R2+R3) x R4/(R3 x G) = codigo/2^23 x 3.1177 ohm."
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
		(at 15.24 226.06 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.4 1.4)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "04432274-bab7-5670-9459-6f6b19a48a99")
	)
	(text "- ADS1252 a 5 V (4.75-5.25 V): elevador MT3608 a 5.1 V + filtro RC R8/C8/C4 (TI). CLK y SCLK pasan por 74AHCT1G125; DOUT baja a 3.3 V con R9/R10."
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
		(at 15.24 229.87 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.4 1.4)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a0fea34d-8cd8-5bc1-885f-2ad222db0967")
	)
	(text "- XIAO: D1 = CLK del ADS (PWM), D2 = DOUT/DRDY, D3 = SCLK, D0 = LED. La bateria va a los pads BAT+/BAT- del XIAO (carga por USB-C)."
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
		(at 15.24 233.68 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.4 1.4)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "1de59b66-db6a-5969-b1fb-bb4d61fe82c2")
	)
	(text "- SIMULAR: Inspeccionar > Simulador > Ejecutar. Senales: V(/V_AMP), V(/VREF), V(/VSET), I(R100). U4-U8, J1, J2, SW1 y la etapa de 5 V excluidos."
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
		(at 15.24 237.49 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.4 1.4)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b2eae3d5-3705-5350-abb0-40a4140ae5fd")
	)
